  <para style="h">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Zakariya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuburira abantu ngo bagaruke k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Mu kwezi kugira umunani kw’umwaka ugira kabiri Dariyusi ari ku ngoma, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryaje ku wavugishwa n’Imana Zakariya mwene Berekiya, Berekiya mwene Ido, rivuga riti:<verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarashavuriye cane ba sogokuruza banyu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Nuko rero, bwira abantu uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Nimungarukeko,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze, ‘nanje nzobagarukako,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Ntimumere nka ba sogokuruza banyu, abo abavugishwa banje ba kera babwiye bati: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: Nimuhindukire muve mu nzira zanyu mbi no mu bikorwa vyanyu bibi, ariko ntibanyumvire canke ngo banshireko n’umutima, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />None ba sogokuruza banyu ubu bari he? Mbega abavugishwa n’Imana bamaho ibihe vyose? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Mbega none amajambo yanje n’ivyo nashinze nkabishikiriza abasavyi banje navugisha ntivyashitse kuri ba sogokuruza banyu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">Maze barihana bavuga bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yadukoreye ibikwiranye n’ingeso zacu n’ibikorwa vyacu, nk’uko yari yagabiye kubitugirira.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuntu agendera ku ndogoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Ku musi ugira mirongo ibiri na kane w’ukwezi kw’indwi, mu kwezi kwa Shebati, mu mwaka ugira kabiri Dariyusi ari ku ngoma, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kuza ku wavugishwa n’Imana Zakariya mwene Berekiya, Berekiya mwene Ido.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />Mw’ijoro nabonye ivyo neretswe, maze imbere yanje hari umugabo yari yicaye kw’ifarasi ifise ibara rigomba gutukura kandi na yo yari ihagaze mu biti vyitwa mirite, ahantu h’umwonga. Inyuma yiwe hari ayandi mafarasi na yo nyene y’akagajo, ayagomba kwera hamwe n’ayera.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Ndabaza nti: “Izo farasi zisigura iki, ga Mwami wanje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">Umumarayika yariko aravugana nanje aranyishura ati: “Ndakwereka ivyo ari vyo.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Maze wa mugabo yari ahagaze muri vya biti vyitwa mirite, aransigurira ati: “Ni abo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arungitse kugendura isi yose.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Maze baha icegeranyo wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari ahagaze musi y’ivyo biti bati: “Twagenduye isi yose kandi twasanze isi yose itekanye iri mu mahoro.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Maze wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, uzogeza ryari kutagirira imbabazi Yerusalemu n’ibisagara vy’i Buyuda, ivyo warakiye kumara iyi myaka mirongo indwi yose?” <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira amajambo meza kandi aremesha wa mumarayika yavugana nanje.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Nuko wa mumarayika yariko aravugana nanje ambwira ati: “Semerera ubu butumwa ubwire abantu bose uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Ngize ipfuhe ku bwa Yerusalemu na Siyoni, <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />kandi ndashavuriye cane amahanga yibereye mu mutekano no mu mahoro. Nari narashavuriye gatoya abantu banje, ariko ayo mahanga yabahaye igihano kirengeje.’<verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Nzohindukirira Yerusalemu mfise imbabazi, kandi aho ni ho Ingoro yanje izosubira kwubakwa. Kandi umugozi wo gupima uzosubira kugororwa i Yerusalemu,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />Semerera umenyeshe abantu uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Ibisagara vyanje bizosubira kwuzura bisesekare ivyiza, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosubira kuremesha Siyoni no gutoranya Yerusalemu.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’amahembe ane n’abacuzi bane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Maze ndavye hejuru, mbona imbere yanje amahembe ane. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Mbaza wa mumarayika yariko aravugana nanje nti: “Ibi ni ibiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">Anyishura ati: “Ayo mahembe aserukira amahanga ane yashwiragije Abayuda n’Abisirayeli n’ab’i Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> anyereka abacuzi bane. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Ndabaza nti: “Abo baje gukora iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:21">Aranyishura ati: “Wabonye ya mahembe ane ari yo mahanga yashwiragije Abayuda kugira ngo ntihagire uwuzokwongera kuvyura umutwe. Aba bacuzi bazanywe no gutera ubwoba ayo mahanga no guca ayo mahembe yayo yadugije ngo agwanye Abayuda no gusanzaza abantu baho.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Umuntu afise umugozi wo gupima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Maze nunamuye amaso, mbona umugabo imbere yanje afise umugozi mu ntoke. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Ndamubaza nti: “Ugiye he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">Aranyishura ati: “Ngiye gupima Yerusalemu, ngo ndabe ubwaguke n’uburebure bwaho.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Mu gihe wa mumarayika yariko aravugana nanje yari agiye, uwundi mumarayika araza barahura <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />maze amubwira ati: “Iruka, ubwire urya musore uti: ‘Yerusalemu kizoba igisagara kitagira inzitiro kubera igitigiri kinini c’abantu n’ibitungwa bizokibamwo. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Kandi jewe ubwanje nzohabera uruzitiro rw’umuriro ruhakikuje rwo kuhakingira,’ uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, ‘kandi nzohabera n’ubwiza bw’imbere muri co!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />“Nimuze! Nimuze! Nimuhunge muve mu gihugu co mu buraruko,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze, “kuko nabashwiragirije mu birere bine umuyaga wo mu kirere utumberamwo,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />“Nuze, yewe Siyoni! Hunga wewe uba ku mukobwa Babiloni!” <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Nyenubwiza amaze kuntuma kugwanya amahanga yabanyaze ivyanyu, kuko yavuze ko uwubakozeko aba akoze mu mbone y’ijisho ryiwe. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Sinzogenda ntabanguriye ukuboko kwanje kuyagwanya kugira ngo abo bari baragize abagurano na bo babanyage ivyabo. Nuko muzomenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ari we yantumye.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />Shira akamo hejuru unezerwe, Mukobwa w’i Siyoni. Kuko ndiko ndaza, kandi nzoba hagati muri wewe,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />“Amahanga menshi azokwifatanya n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuri uwo musi kandi azohinduka abantu banje. Nzoba muri mwebwe namwe muzomenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ari we yabantumyeko. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoronka i Buyuda nk’umugabane wiwe mu gihugu cejejwe kandi azosubira gutoranya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Tekerereza imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe abafise umubiri mwese, kuko yikanguye ava ahera hiwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Imyambaro itanduye y’Umuherezi mukuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Maze anyereka Yosuwa umuherezi mukuru ahagaze imbere y’umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na Satani ahagaze i buryo bwiwe ngo amwagirize. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Satani ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhane, Satani! <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yitoranirije Yerusalemu, aguhane! Mbega uwu muntu ntameze nk’igishirira cokowe kiva mu muriro?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Kandi Yosuwa yari yambaye impuzu zanduye ahagaze imbere y’umumarayika. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Uwo mumarayika abwira abari bahagaze imbere yiwe ati: “Nimumwambure izo mpuzu zanduye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 3:4">Maze abwira Yosuwa ati: “Raba, ndagukuyeko icaha cawe, kandi ngira nkwambike impuzu nziza.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Maze ndavuga nti: “Nimumwambike n’igitambara ciza mu mutwe.” Nuko baca bamwambika igitambara ciza mu mutwe, mu gihe umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari agihagaze ngaho.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Yosuwa aya majambo ati: <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Niwamwumvira ukitondera ivyo yihanikirije, uzoganza Ingoro yiwe kandi azokuzeza abo mu rugo rwiwe, kandi azoguha ikibanza hagati y’aba bahagaze ngaha.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />“Niwumve yewe Yosuwa umuherezi mukuru, wewe na bagenzi bawe bicara imbere yawe, mukaba ikimenyetso c’ibizoza. Ngiye kuzana umusavyi wanje, yitwa Shami.” <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Raba ibuye nashize imbere ya Yosuwa! Iryo buye rifise impande indwi, kandi nzokwandika kuri iryo buye ibikwiye kwandikwako, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze; kandi nzokuraho icaha c’iri hanga ku musi umwe gusa.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />“ ‘Kuri uwo musi, umwe wese muri mwebwe azotumira umubanyi wiwe ngo bicarane musi y’umuzabibu n’umusukoni wiwe,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Igiterekwako amatara n’ibiti bibiri vy’imyelayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Maze umumarayika yavugana nanje aragaruka aza kumvyura, nk’uko umuntu avyurwa iyo yari asinziriye. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Arambaza ati: “Mbega ubona iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Ndamwishura nti: “Mbona igiterekwako amatara cose gikozwe mu nzahabu n’igikombe c’amavuta hejuru yaco, mbona n’amatara indwi ari kuri co, kandi gifise n’imiheha indwi ija kuri ayo matara. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Mbona kandi hari n’ibiti vy’imyelayo bibiri i ruhande yaco, kimwe i buryo bw’ico giterekwako amatara ikindi i bubamfu bwaco.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Nca mbaza wa mumarayika yavugana nanje nti: “Ibi ni ibiki, Mwami wanje?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Aranyishura ati: “Ibi ntuzi ivyo ari vyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Ndamwishura nti: “Oya Mwami wanje.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Nuko aca ambwira ati: “Iri ni ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> utumwe kubwira Zerubabeli uti: ‘Si ku bw’inkomezi canke ku bw’ubushobozi, ariko ni ku bwa Mpwemu wanje,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />Wa musozi munini we, uri iki? Imbere ya Zerubabeli uzohinduka ikiyaya. Maze na we azozana ibuye rya nyuma rigumya imfuruka, kandi abantu na bo bazosemerera bavuga bati: ‘Mana rihezagire! Mana rihezagire!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ampa irindi jambo ati: <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />“Amaboko ya Zerubabeli ni yo yashizeho urufatiro rw’uru rusengero; kandi amaboko yiwe ni yo azorusozera. Maze muzomenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ari we yabantumyeko.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />Uri nde wewe wubahuka kugaya ibintu kuko bikiri bito biri mu ntango? Nayo arya matara indwi yerekana inyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> zigendagenda mw’isi yose, kandi azonezerwa abonye karisho mu kuboko kwa Zerubabeli?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Maze mbaza uwo mumarayika nti: “Ibi biti vy’imyelayo bibiri kimwe i buryo ikindi i bubamfu bw’igiterekwako amatara bisigura iki?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Kandi ndongera ndamubaza nti: “Ayo mashami abiri ari i ruhande y’imiheha ibiri y’inzahabu ivamwo amavuta y’inzahabu ni iki?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Aranyishura ati: “Ntuzi ivyo ari vyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Ndavuga nti: “Oya, Mwami wanje.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Nuko aravuga ati: “Ivyo ni abantu babiri barobanujwe amavuta ngo bakorere Umwami w’isi yose.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Umuzingo uguruka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Ndasubira ndaraba, mbona imbere yanje umuzingo uguruka.<verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Maze wa mumarayika arambaza ati: “Ubona iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Ndamwishura nti: “Mbona umuzingo uguruka, ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri z’uburebure na cumi z’ubwaguke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 9 z’uburebure n’imetero 4,5 z’ubwaguke.</char></note>.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Aca arambwira ati: “Uyu ni umuvumo ugiye mu gihugu cose; kuko nk’uko wanditseko ku ruhande rumwe, abasuma bose bazokwirukanwa bave mu gihugu, kandi nk’uko wanditseko ku rundi ruhande, abarahira ibinyoma bose bazokwirukanwa. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze ati: ‘Nzowutuma usohoke, maze uzokwinjira mu nzu y’umusuma wese no mu nzu y’uwurahira ibinyoma wese mw’izina ryanje. Uzoguma muri iyo nzu kandi uzoyisambura yose, zaba imbaho, yaba n’amabuye ayubatse.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugore ari mu giseke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Nuko umumarayika yari yamye avugana nanje aranyegera aza aho ndi arambwira ati: “Rangamiza urabe kirya kintu giserutse.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Ndamubaza nti: “Kirya ni igiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">Aranyishura ati: “Ni igiseke.” Arongerako ati: “Ico giseke cuzuye ukugabitanya kw’abantu bo muri iki gihugu cose.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Maze umupfundikizo waco ukozwe mu muringa ukurwaho, hanyuma mbona muri ca giseke umugore yicayemwo! <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Wa mumarayika aca ambwira ati: “Uyu ni ukugabitanya,” maze aca amutsindagira muri ca giseke aca ashirako wa mupfundikizo ukozwe mu muringa.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Maze ntaramuye amaso, mbona imbere yanje abagore babiri, baguruka baza aho turi batekeye umuyaga mu mababa yabo! Bari bafise amababa nk’ay’agasoza, baca baterura ca giseke bagitwara mu kirere.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Mbaza wa mumarayika yavugana nanje nti: “Mbega kirya giseke bakijanye he?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Anyishura ati: “Bakijanye mu gihugu c’i Babiloni aho bazocubakira ingoro. Iyo ngoro niyuzura, ico giseke bazogishira aho categuriwe kigaragare cane.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Imikogote ine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Nsubiriye kwunamura amaso, mbona imbere yanje imikogote ine isokoroka ivuye hagati y’imisozi ibiri, kandi iyo misozi yari imisozi y’umwakaka. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Umukogote wa mbere wakwegwa n’amafarasi y’akagajo, uwa kabiri wakwegwa n’ayirabura, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />uwa gatatu wakwegwa n’ayera, uwa kane na wo wakwegwa n’ayafise amabara menshi, kandi yose yari afise inkomezi nyinshi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Mbaza wa mumarayika yavugana nanje nti: “Ivyo ni ibiki ga mwami wanje?”<verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Wa mumarayika aranyishura ati: “Izo ni impwemu zine zo mw’ijuru, zisohotse ziva aho zama zihagaze imbere y’Umwami aganza isi yose. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Urya mukogote ufise amafarasi yirabura ugiye werekeye igihugu co mu buraruko, uw’amafarasi yera werekeye mu burengero, uw’amafarasi afise amabara menshi na wo werekeye mu bumanuko.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Igihe ayo mafarasi y’inkomezi nyinshi yasohoka, yashaka kugendagenda mw’isi yose. Maze uwo mumarayika aca avuga ati: “Nimugendagende mw’isi yose!” Nuko aca agenda kugenzura isi yose.<verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Maze uwo mumarayika arampamagara ati: “Raba, amwe agiye yerekeye mu gihugu co mu buraruko gusukayo uburake bwanje bituma umutima wanje uruhuka ku vy’igihugu co mu buraruko.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urugori rwa Yosuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rirambwira riti: <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />“Niwakire ifeza n’inzahabu ku bari barajanywe ari inyagano ari bo Heludayi, Tobiya na Yedaya, bashitse bavuye i Babiloni. Ugende uwo musi nyene kwa Yosiya mwene Zefaniya. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Ujane za feza na za nzahabu ucure urugori maze urwambike Yosuwa mwene Yehozadaki, umuherezi mukuru, ku mutwe. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />Umubwire uti uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Ehe umuntu yitwa Shami araje, kandi azoshamikira mu kibanza ciwe maze yubake urusengero rw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />Ni we azokwubaka urusengero rw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, azokwambikwa icubahiro c’inganji maze yicare ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami aganze. Ari ku ntebe yiwe y’ubwami, azoba n’umuherezi, kandi ayo mabanga yiwe abiri azoyahuza neza mu rutonde ntangere.’ <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Urwo rugori ruzobwa Heludayi, Tobiya, Yedaya na Heni mwene Zefaniya nk’icibutso mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Abari kure bazoza bafashe kwubaka urusengero rw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze muzomenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yabantumyeko. Ivyo bizoba nimwagira umwete wo kwumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Imanza ziroranye no kugira imbabazi, aho kwisonzesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Mu mwaka ugira kane umwami Dariyusi ari ku ngoma, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryaje kuri Zakariya ku musi ugira kane w’ukwezi kw’icenda, ari kwo Kisilevu. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Abantu b’i Beteli bari batumye Sharezeri na Regemu-Meleki, hamwe n’abantu babo, ngo babasigurize <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />mu kubaza abaherezi bo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose n’abavugishwa n’Imana ngo: “Tuzobandanya kuboroga no kwisonzesha mu kwezi kugira gatanu, nk’uko twagumye tubigira muri iyi myaka yose ishize, twibuka umusi urusengero rwasamburwa?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yongera kumbwira ijambo ati: <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Baza abantu bo mu gihugu hamwe n’abaherezi uti: ‘Hamwe mwisonzesha mukaboroga mu kwezi kugira gatanu no mu kugira indwi muri iyi myaka iheze uko ari mirongo indwi, mbega harya vy’ukuri mwisonzesha ku bwanje? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Kandi igihe mwarya mukanywa, ntimwaba muriko murinezereza mwebwe ubwanyu? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Mbega aya si yo majambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabamenyesheje ayacishije mu bo yavugisha ba kera igihe Yerusalemu n’ibisagara vyari bihakikije vyari mu mutekano kandi vyuzuye ubutunzi, na Negebu n’ibiyaya vyaho bikirimwo abantu?’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kuza kuri Zakariya riti: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Nimuce imanza zibereye; mugire imbabazi mubabarane. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Ntimucinyize umupfakazi n’impfuvyi, inyambukira canke umukene. Ntimugire inama yo kugirira abandi nabi.’<verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />Ariko banka kwumva; bakomantaza imitima yabo bantera ibitugu biziba amatwi. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Imitima yabo barayikomantaza bayigira nk’ibuye ntibumvira ivyagezwe n’amajambo y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yari yabatumyeko akoresheje Mpwemu wiwe yavugisha abavugishwa biwe ba kera. Ni co catumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose araka cane.<verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />‘Aho nahamagara, ntibanyumvirije; ni co catumye igihe bahamagara, nanje ntabumvirije,’ ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />‘Nabasanzarishije agashururu mu mahanga yose, aho babaye inyambukira. Igihugu bavuyemwo casigaye ari imisaka ku buryo ata muntu yagicamwo. Uko ni ko bahinduye imisaka ico gihugu c’igikundiro.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asezerana guhezagira Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Iri ni ijambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yambariye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Mfise ipfuhe ryinshi ku bwa Siyoni; ndahafitiye ipfuhe rirurumba muri jewe kurya kw’umuriro.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: “Nzogaruka i Siyoni mbe muri Yerusalemu. Maze Yerusalemu hazokwitwa igisagara co kwizigirwa, kandi umusozi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose uzokwitwa Umusozi Wera.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Abatama n’abatamakazi bazosubira kandi kugendagenda mu mabarabara y’i Yerusalemu, umwe wese yitwaje inkoni kubera ubusaza. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Amayira y’igisagara azokwuzura abahungu n’abakobwa bakiniraho.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Naho ivyo womenga biratangaje ku masigarira y’aba bantu muri iki gihe, mbega no kuri jewe vyoba ibitangaje?” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Nzokiza abantu banje ndabakure mu bihugu vyo mu buseruko n’ivyo mu burengero. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Nzobagarukana ngo babe i Yerusalemu; bazoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba umwizigirwa n’umugororotsi kuko ndi Imana yabo.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “None rero nimwumve aya majambo: amaboko yanyu nakomere, mwubake urusengero. Ibi ni vyo nyene abavugishwa n’Imana bavuze igihe itanguriro ry’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ryashirwaho. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Imbere y’aho nta muntu yatanga impembo y’umukozi yo ku musi canke ngo akoteshe inka. Nta n’umwe yaja ku bikorwa vyiwe ngo agaruke amahoro kubera abansi, kandi kuko nari nahinduye umwe wese ngo abe umwansi wa mugenziwe. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Ariko ubu nzogirira amasigarira y’ubu bwoko nk’uko nabagirira kera,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />“Imbuto zizokura neza, umuzabibu uzokwama ivyamwa vyawo, isi izotuma haba ivyimburwa, n’amajuru azozana ikime cayo. Ivyo vyose nzobiha amasigarira y’aba bantu ngo bibe umwandu wabo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Nk’uko mwebwe, Abayuda n’Abisirayeli, mwabaye umuvumo mu mahanga, ni ko nzobakiza, kandi muzoba umugisha. Ntimutinye, ahubwo amaboko yanyu nakomere.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ati: “Nk’uko nafashe ingingo yo kubateza ivyago no kutabagirira akagongwe igihe ba sogokuruza banyu bandatsa,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />“ni ko n’ubu mfashe ingingo yo gusubira kugirira neza Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda. Ntimutinye. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Ibi ni vyo mukwiye gukora: muvugane ukuri na bagenzi banyu, kandi muce imanza z’ukuri kandi zibereye mu bucamanza bwanyu; <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />ntimugire inama zo kugirira bagenzi banyu nabi, kandi ntimukunde kurahira ibinyoma. Ivyo ndavyanka,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose rinzako.<verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Ukwisonzesha no kugandara vyo mu kwezi kugira kane n’ukugira gatanu n’ukw’indwi n’ukw’icumi, ubu birarangiye, bihindutse imisi mikuru y’umunezero ku Bayuda. Nuko rero mukunde ukuri n’amahoro.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Amoko menshi n’ababa mu bisagara vyinshi bazoza, <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />ababa mu gisagara kimwe bazoja mu kindi babwirane bati: ‘Ingo tujane gutazira no kwambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose. Jewe ubwanje ndagiye.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Kandi amoko menshi n’amahanga ahambaye azoza i Yerusalemu kurondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose kugira ngo amusabe umuhezagiro.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: “Muri iyo misi abantu cumi bo mu ndimi zose n’amahanga bazofata Umuyuda umwe ku buyonga bw’impuzu yiwe bavuge bati: Reka tujane nawe, kuko twumvise ko Imana iri kumwe namwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza ruzocirwa abansi ba Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Ivyavugishijwe Zakariya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryarumvikanye ryo kwagiriza igihugu ca Haduraki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">kandi rizoza kuruhukira kuri Damasiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">kuko inyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ziri ku bantu bose hamwe n’imiryango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">yose y’Abisirayeli,<verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />ziri no kuri Hamati na ho nyene, ahahana urubibe na ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">no kuri Tiro n’i Sidoni, naho bazi ubwenge bwinshi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Tiro hiyubakiye uruzitiro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">hirundaniriza ifeza nk’umukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">n’inzahabu nk’umwavu wo mu mabarabara.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Ariko Imana izojana ubutunzi bwaho bwose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">kandi izosenyurira inkomezi zaho mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">kandi hazotongozwa umuriro.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Igisagara Ashikeloni kizobibona gitinye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">i Gaza bazohinda agashitsi kubera ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">na Ekuroni na ho nyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">kuko ivyizigiro vyaho bizoba biheze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaza hazobura umwami waho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">kandi Ashikeloni na ho hazosigara ari ubugaragwa.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Abantu b’ibivyarwa ni bo bazokwibera muri Ashidodi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:6">kandi nzomara ubwibone Abafilisitiya.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Nzokura inyama zikirimwo amaraso mu minwa yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">nkure n’ivyokurya baterekereye ibigirwamana mu menyo yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Abasigaye bazoba inyegu y’Imana yacu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">kandi bazohinduka umuryango umwe wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">kandi n’abo muri Ekuroni bazohinduka nk’Abayebusi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Ariko jewe nzoshira ikirindiro canje ku rusengero rwanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">ngo ndarurinde ingabo zoza kurutera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Nta wucinyiza azosubira guca mu bantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">kuko ndaharinze.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuza kw’Umwami w’i Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Nezerwa cane Mukobwa w’i Siyoni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ushire ijwi ryawe hejuru, Mukobwa w’i Yerusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Raba, umwami wawe arakugendeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">ni umugororotsi kandi afise intsinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">yicishije bugufi kandi agendera ku ndogoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">mbere aje ku nyana yayo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Nzokuraho imikogote muri Efurayimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">n’amafarasi y’intambara ndayakure muri Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">nzovunagura n’imiheto yo ku rugamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Azovuga ivy’amahoro mu mahanga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Ukuganza kwiwe kuzova ku kiyaga gushike ku kindi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">no kuva ku ruzi Efurate gushika ku mpera z’isi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Ariko mweho, kubera amaraso yanje y’isezerano dufitaniye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">nzobarekurira imbohe zanyu ndazikure mu rwobo rutagira amazi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Nimugaruke mu kibanza muzigamirwamwo, yemwe mbohe ziri n’ivyizigiro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">mbere n’ubu ndabamenyesheje ko nzobashumbusha incuro zibiri imibabaro.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Nzogonda i Buyuda nk’uko bagonda umuheto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">maze Efurayimu ndabahindure nk’umwampi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Nzokabura abahungu bawe, ewe Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">ngo batere abahungu bawe, ewe Bugiriki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">nzobagira nk’inkota y’umuhizi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoseruka</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoseruka hejuru y’abantu biwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">umwampi wiwe uzorabagirana nk’umuravyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji azovuza inzamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">azogendera mu bihuhusi nk’ivy’umuyaga wo mu bumanuko,<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azobabera inkinzo ibakingira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Bazosangangura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">bongere batsinde abansi babo bakoresheje amabuye atereshwa umugozi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Bazokwiha akamo mu ntambara nk’ababorewe umuvinyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">bazoba buzuye amaraso nk’uko igikombe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">gikoreshwa mu gucucagira imfuruka z’igicaniro.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo azotabara abantu biwe kuri uwo musi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">nk’uko umwungere atabara imikuku yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Bazokayangana mu gihugu ciwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">nk’amabuye y’igiciro ari ku rugori.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Ese ukugene bazoba ari beza kandi bateye igomwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">Ingano zizotuma abasore bakura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">kandi n’umutobe ni ko uzobera abakobwa.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwitaho i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Nimusabe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imvura mu gihe c’impeshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we aganza ibicu n’imituragaro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Atanga imvura y’umuvuvu ku bantu bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">akameza ibiterwa bitotahaye mu mirima y’umuntu wese.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Ibigirwamana bivuga ibinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">abahamagara imizimu berekwa ibinyoma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Barotora inzozi z’ibinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">bakaremesha abantu mu vy’ubusabusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Ni co gituma abantu basanzara hirya no hino nk’intama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">zihahazwa kubera kubura umwungere.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />“Uburake bwanje buri ku bungere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">kandi nzohana abo batware;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azokwitwararika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">umukuku wiwe, ari bo bantu b’i Buyuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">abahindure nk’ifarasi y’ubwibone mu ntambara.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Muri Yuda hazovamwo ibuye rigumya imfuruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">muri we hazovamwo urumambo rugumya ihema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">muri we hazovamwo umuheto w’intambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">muri we hazovamwo abatware bose.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Bose hamwe bazoba nk’abahizi mu ntambara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">basiribangira umwansi wabo mu vyondo vyo mu mabarabara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Bazogwana kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe na bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">kandi bazotuma abansi babo bagwanira ku mafarasi bamaramara.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />Nzoha inkomezi Yuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">kandi nzotabara imiryango ya Yosefu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Nzobagarukana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">kuko ndabagirira impuhwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Nzomera nk’aho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">ntigeze ndabaheba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">kuko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">kandi nzobishura amasengesho yabo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Abefurayimu bazoba nk’abahizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">kandi imitima yabo izonezerwa nk’ababorewe umuvinyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Abana babo bazobibona bahimbarwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">imitima yabo izonezererwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />Nzobahamagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">ndabegeranye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Vy’ukuri nzobacungura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">bazoba benshi bagwire nka kera.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Naho nabasanzarije mu mahanga menshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">bazonyibuka bari mu bihugu vya kure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Kandi bo n’abana babo bazobaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">kandi bazogaruka.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Nzobagarukana ndabakure muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">ndabegeranye ndabakuye muri Ashuri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Nzobazana i Gileyadi n’i Libani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">kandi ntibazoronka aho bakwirwa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Bazoca mu kiyaga c’amarushwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">nzotururuza imipfunda yo mu kiyaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">n’i bwina h’uruzi Nili hazokwuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Ubwibone bwa Ashuri buzotururuzwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">n’icumu ry’ubugabe rya Egiputa rizokurwaho.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Nzobaha inkomezi zivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">kandi mw’izina ryiwe bazobaho mu mutekano,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Ugurura amarembo yawe, ewe Libani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">kugira ngo umuriro utongore amasederi yawe!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Nimuboroge, yemwe biti vy’ubujwari, kubera amasederi yiciwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">ibiti biteye igomwe vyaguye hasi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Nimuboroge, yemwe biti binini cane vy’i Bashani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">kuko ishamba ryari rizitanye ryatemwe!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Umviriza ukuboroga kw’abungere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">kuko uburagiro butotahaye bwabo bwakuweho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Umviriza ukuroha kw’intambwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">kuko ubwihisho bwazo bwo kuri Yorodani bwakuweho.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abungere babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje avuze: “Ragira umukuku wagerewe gukererwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Abaziguze barazikerera bakigira badahanywe. Abazigurishije na bo bakavuga bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahimbazwe, turi abatunzi!’ N’abungere bazo ubwabo ntibaruha bazigirira akagongwe. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Ni nk’uko nyene, sinzosubira kugirira akagongwe abantu b’iki gihugu,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. “Nzotanga umuntu wese mu maboko y’abagenzi biwe n’umwami wabo. Bazotabagura igihugu, kandi sinzotabara n’umwe ngo ndamubakure mu maboko.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Nuko nca ndagira wa mukuku wagerewe kubagwa, canecane izihahazwa zo mu mukuku. Maze nca nakira inkoni zibiri, imwe ndayita Buntu iyindi Bumwe, maze nca ngenda kuragira wa mukuku. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Mu kwezi kumwe nca nirukana abungere bawo batatu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 11:8">Wa mukuku uca uranyanka, nanje ndushaho kugenda ndawurambirwa <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />maze ndavuga nti: “Sinzoba umwungere wanyu. Reka iyiriko irapfa ipfe, iyo kwicwa na yo yicwe. Izisigaye na zo ziryane zihezanye ubwazo.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Nuko mfata ya nkoni yitwa Buntu ndayivunamwo kubiri, kugira ngo nerekane ko nkuyeho isezerano nasezeranye n’amahanga yose. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Rica rikurwaho kuri uwo musi nyene, maze izacinyijwe zo mu mukuku zariko zirandaba zica zimenya ko ari ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Ndazibwira nti: “Nimba bibabereye vyiza, nimumpe impembo yanje; ariko bitari uko, nimuyigumye.” Nuko bampemba ibiceri vy’ifeza mirongo itatu.<verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Yaterere umubumvyi,” ico giciro ciza babonye ko nkwiye! Nuko nca mfata vya biceri vy’ifeza mirongo itatu ndabiterera umubumvyi mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Ndaheza mvuna ya nkoni igira kabiri yitwa Bumwe, mba mvunye ubumwe hagati ya Yuda na Isirayeli.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambarira ati: “Subira wakire ibikoresho vya wa mwungere w’igipfu. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Kuko ngiye guhagurutsa umwungere w’iki gihugu atazobabara izazimiye, canke ngo arondere imyagazi, canke ngo avure izakomeretse, canke ngo agaburire izikomeye. Ahubwo azorya inyama z’intama z’indobanurwa, kugeza no ku binono.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />Aragowe uwo mwungere w’igipfu ata co amaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">uwo ata umukuku!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Aragakubitwa inkota ku kuboko no ku jisho ry’i buryo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">Ukuboko kwiwe nikunyunyuke rwose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">ijisho ryiwe ry’i buryo na ryo rihume rwose!”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s1">Abansi ba Yerusalemu bazorandurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Ivyavugishijwe Zakariya: Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryerekeye Abisirayeli.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 12:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 12:1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni we yashanje amajuru, ashiraho urufatiro rw’isi, kandi ni we arema agashira impwemu mu muntu, avuze ati: <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Ngiye guhindura Yerusalemu kuba igikombe kiboreza amahanga yose ahakikuje. I Buyuda hazokwugarizwa hamwe n’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Kuri uwo musi, aho amahanga yose yo kw’isi azoba yakoraniye kuhagwanya, nzohindura Yerusalemu igitandara kitanyiganyizwa ku mahanga yose. Abazogerageza kukinyiganyiza ni bo bazokomereka. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Kuri uwo musi nzoteza ifarasi yose ubwoba, uwuyigenderako na we ndamuteze ibisazi,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. “Nzogumiza ijisho ryanje kuri Yuda, ariko nzoteza uruhumyi amafarasi yose y’amahanga. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Maze abakuru b’imiryango ya Yuda bazovuga mu mitima yabo bati: ‘Abantu b’i Yerusalemu ni abanyenkomezi, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ari Imana yabo.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />Kuri uwo musi nzohindura imiryango ya Yuda imere nk’umuriro mu kirundo c’inkwi, canke nk’igishirira kiri mu miganda y’ingano. Bazotongora amahanga abakikije i buryo n’i bubamfu, ariko Yerusalemu ho hazoguma hahangamye mu kibanza caho.”<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotabara amazu y’Abayuda ubwa mbere, kugira ngo icubahiro c’inzu ya Dawidi n’ic’ababa i Yerusalemu ntikirute ica Yuda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Kuri uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokingira ababa i Yerusalemu, kugira ngo umunyantegenke wo muri bo aze abe nka Dawidi, n’uruvyaro rwa Dawidi ruze rube nk’Imana, canke nk’umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agiye imbere yabo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Kuri uwo musi nzosohokanwa no gusangangura amahanga yose azotera Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uko bazoborogera uwo bacumise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />Nzosuka ku nzu ya Dawidi no ku baba i Yerusalemu impwemu y’ubuntu no gusenga. Bazondaba, jewe uwo bacumise, maze baboroge nk’uwuborogera umwana wiwe w’ikinege, bagandare nk’uwugandarira imfura yiwe. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Kuri uwo musi gucura intimba muri Yerusalemu kuzoba kwinshi nka kwa gucura intimba ku bwa Hadadi-Rimoni mu kiyaya c’i Megido. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Igihugu kizoboroga, umuryango wose ukwawo, hamwe n’abagore babo ukwabo: umuryango w’inzu ya Dawidi n’abagore babo, umuryango w’inzu ya Natani n’abagore babo, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />umuryango w’inzu ya Lewi n’abagore babo, umuryango wa Shimeyi n’abagore babo, <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />n’abasigaye bose bo mu miryango n’abagore babo.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwozwa ivyaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />“Kuri uwo musi iriba rizotoborerwa abo mu nzu ya Dawidi n’ababa i Yerusalemu, kugira ngo ruboze icaha n’ubuhumane.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />Kuri uwo musi, nzozimanganya abasenga ibigirwamana mu gihugu, ku buryo n’amazina yavyo atazosubira kwibukwa,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze. “Nzokuraho ba kamenyi n’impwemu ihumanya mu gihugu. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Kandi nihagira n’umuntu n’umwe yongera kuvugishwa, se na nyina bamwivyariye, bazomubwira bati: ‘Ntugenda udapfuye, kuko wavuze ibinyoma mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ Maze abavyeyi biwe bwite ni bo bazomusogota.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />Kuri uwo musi umuntu wese avugishwa azogira isoni zo kuvuga ko yeretswe. Kandi ntibazosubira kwambara impuzu zibaranga nk’abavugishwa kugira ngo babeshe abantu. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Umwe wese azovuga ati: ‘Sindi umuvugishwa. Ndi umurimyi; mbeshejweho n’ukurima isi kuva mu buto bwanje.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Nihagira uwubabaza ati: ‘Ivyo bikomere ku mubiri wawe vyavuye kuki?’ bazomwishura bati: ‘Ni ivyo nakomerekeye mu nzu y’abagenzi banje.’<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwungere akubiswe, intama zirasanzara</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />Vyuka, yewe wa nkota, ukubite umwungere wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ukubite urya muntu ari hafi yanje,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Kubita umwungere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">intama zisanzare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">nanje nzohindukiriza ukuboko kwanje kugwanya imyagazi.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Mu gihugu cose, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">babiri kuri batatu bazokwicwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">umwe muri batatu ni we azosigara.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Abo bazoba basigaye, ni bo nzocisha mu muriro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">nzobamara inkamba nk’ifeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">ndabagerageze nk’inzahabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Bazokwambaza izina ryanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">nanje nzobishura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">nzovuga nti: ‘Ni abantu banje,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">na bo bazovuga bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we Mana yacu.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araje kuganza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Umusi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uraje, ewe Yerusalemu, aho ubutunzi bwawe buzosahurwa bukagabanganirizwa hagati mu nzitiro zawe.<verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Nzokoraniriza amahanga yose i Yerusalemu ngo bahagwanye; ico gisagara kizofatwa mpiri, amazu asahurwe, n’abagore bafatwe ku nguvu. Igice c’igisagara kizojanwa ari inyagano, ariko abasigaye ntibazokurwa mu gisagara. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosohokanwa no kugwanya ayo mahanga, nk’uko agwana ku musi w’intambara. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Kuri uwo musi ibirenge vyiwe bizohagarara ku Musozi wa Elayono, uri mu buseruko bw’i Yerusalemu, maze Umusozi wa Elayono uzosadukamwo kubiri uhereye mu buseruko ukageza mu burengero, haboneke ikiyaya kinini, igice kimwe c’uwo musozi cimuke kija mu buraruko ikindi mu bumanuko. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Muzohungira muri ico kiyaya canje c’uwo musozi, kuko kizoshika muri Azeli. Muzohunga nk’uko mwahunze nyamugigima mu misi ya Uziya umwami w’i Buyuda. Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje azoza, ari kumwe n’abejejwe bose.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Kuri uwo musi izuba ntirizokwaka canke ngo habe gukanya, canke umwijima. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Uzoba ari umusi wisa, umusi uzwi n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene, ata gutandukanya umurango n’ijoro. No mu gihe c’umugoroba umuco uzogumaho.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Kuri uwo musi amazi y’ubugingo azotemba ava i Yerusalemu, igice kimwe kizoja mu buseruko mu Kiyaga c’Umunyu ikindi gice kije mu burengero mu Kiyaga Mediterane, mu ci no mu gihe c’imbeho nyinshi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba umwami w’isi yose. Kuri uwo musi hazoba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> umwe, kandi izina ryiwe rizoba rimwe rudende.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Igihugu cose, uhereye i Geba ugashika i Rimoni, mu bumanuko bwa Yerusalemu, kizoba nka Araba. Ariko Yerusalemu hazoshirwa hejuru cane uhereye kw’Irembo rya Benyamini ukageza mu kibanza c’Irembo rya Mbere, ukabandanya ukageza kw’Irembo ryo mu Mfuruka, ugakomeza ukava ku munara wa Hananeli ukageza ku bwato bwo kuganiramwo umuvinyu bw’i bwami. Kandi hazoguma mu kibanza caho. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Abantu bazohaba; kandi ntihazokwongera gusamburwa. Yerusalemu hazoba umutekano.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Iki ni co cago <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoteza amahanga yose azotera i Yerusalemu: inyama zabo zizobora bakigendagenda, amaso yabo aborere mu bibanza vyayo, n’indimi zabo zizoborera mu kanwa kabo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Kuri uwo musi abantu bazoterwa ubwoba n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Bazosubiranamwo bagwane. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Yuda na we azogwanira i Yerusalemu. Ubutunzi bw’ibihugu bihakikije buzokwegeranywa; inzahabu n’ifeza vyinshi cane n’impuzu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Icago nk’ico kizoshika ku mafarasi n’inyumbu, ingamiya n’indogoba, n’ibindi bitungano bizoba muri ayo makambi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Maze abazocika kw’icumu bo mu mahanga yose yateye Yerusalemu bazoduga uko umwaka utashe gusenga Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, no guhimbaza imisi mikuru y’insago. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Kandi nihagira umuntu n’umwe wo muri ayo moko yo kw’isi atazoduga i Yerusalemu gusenga Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, ntazoronka imvura. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Abanyegiputa nibataduga ngo bifatanye n’abandi, nta mvura bazoronka. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobarekurirako icago azoteza amahanga ataza guhimbaza umusi mukuru w’insago. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Ico kizoba ari igihano kuri Egiputa n’igihano ku mahanga yose atazoduga guhimbaza umusi mukuru w’insago.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Kuri uwo musi amajambo “Yerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>” azokwandikwa ku mijiginya y’amafarasi, n’inkono zo gutekamwo zo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> zizoba nk’ibikoresho vy’imbere y’igicaniro. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Inkono zose z’i Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda zizoba zerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, kandi abazoza gushikana ibimazi bazokwakira zimwe muri izo nkono bazitekemwo. Kandi kuri uwo musi ntihazoba Umunyakanani mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>